------------------------------ README.md ------------------------------
       1	# Biforch Reverse-Proxy Agent
       2	
       3	> High‑level, opinionated reverse‑proxy side‑car that keeps backend ACLs in sync
       4	> with **Biforch Core** — ships with Nginx today and is built to support Caddy, Traefik, HAProxy and other engines tomorrow.
       5	
       6	![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.11%20%7C%203.12-blue)
       7	![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green)
       8	
       9	---
      10	
      11	## ✨ Features
      12	
      13	* **FastAPI** REST endpoint for runtime rule management.
      14	* **SQLite** + SQLAlchemy for a lightweight local cache.
      15	* **Pluggable back‑ends** – currently Nginx; Caddy/Traefik/Haproxy ready.
      16	* **Zero‑touch discovery** – detects new `*.conf` snippets, registers them with Core.
      17	* **Idempotent sync** – generates per‑service snippets and reloads Nginx when needed.
      18	
      19	## 📂 Project layout
      20	
      21	```text
      22	reverse_proxy_agent/         ← package root  
      23	├── api.py                   ← FastAPI app entry‑point  
      24	├── config.py                ← typed settings, loaded from `.env`  
      25	├── models.py / database.py  ← SQLAlchemy ORM & engine  
      26	├── services/                ← business logic (rule sync, discovery)  
      27	├── backends/                ← proxy back‑end implementations  
      28	└── …                        ← utils, schemas, clients…
      29	```
      30	
      31	## ⚙️ Configuration (`.env`)
      32	
      33	| Key             | Example                                | Notes                                |
      34	| --------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
      35	| `CONFIG_DIR`    | `../nginx/auto.d/`                     | Folder where ACL snippets live       |
      36	| `DB_PATH`       | `reverse_proxy.db`                     | Relative/absolute SQLite path        |
      37	| `CORE_URL`      | `http://192.168.87.10:8001`            | Biforch Core base URL                |
      38	| `BIFORCH_TOKEN`      | `xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx`     | Bearer token recognised by Core      |
      39	| `BIFORCH_UUID`       | `589f29be-5729-4ac9-9004-723decbb897f` | Reverse‑proxy agent UUID             |
      40	| `PROXY_BACKEND` | `nginx`                                | allowed values (`nginx`, `caddy`, …) |
      41	| `TIMEOUT`       | `5`                                    | outgoing HTTP timeout (seconds)      |
      42	
      43	## 🚀 Usage
      44	
      45	### Local dev
      46	
      47	```bash
      48	# install deps & the package itself
      49	poetry install --with dev
      50	
      51	# run the API (reload enabled)
      52	poetry run reverse-proxy-agent
      53	```
      54	
      55	### Production (systemd example)
      56	
      57	```ini
      58	[Unit]
      59	Description=Biforch Reverse-Proxy Agent
      60	After=network.target
      61	
      62	[Service]
      63	User=www-data
      64	WorkingDirectory=/opt/biforch-rp
      65	EnvironmentFile=/opt/biforch-rp/.env
      66	ExecStart=/opt/biforch-rp/.venv/bin/reverse-proxy-agent
      67	Restart=on-failure
      68	
      69	[Install]
      70	WantedBy=multi-user.target
      71	```
      72	
      73	## 🧪 Tests
      74	
      75	```bash
      76	poetry run pytest -q --cov
      77	```
